meta {
  name: User Login
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "username": "vishal1232@gmail.com",
    "password": "Password123!",
    "role": "founder"
  }
}

docs {
  # User Login
  Authenticate an existing Founder, Mentor, or Admin with username/email and password.

  ### Authentication
  Public (No authorization header required)

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Request Body Fields
  - `username` (string, required) - Registered username or email address.
  - `password` (string, required) - Plaintext password.
  - `role` (string, optional) - Target dashboard role ("founder" | "mentor" | "admin").

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Authentication successful. Returns user object, token, and role.
  - `400` - Missing username or required credentials.
  - `401` - Invalid username or password.
  - `403` - Account pending mentor approval or suspended by Admin.
  - `500` - Internal server error.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "user": {
      "id": "usr_founder_01",
      "name": "Vishal Kumar",
      "email": "vishal1232@gmail.com",
      "role": "founder",
      "status": "active",
      "token": "jwt_sample_token_founder"
    }
  }
  ```
}
